<title>SRI LANKA: Bogawantalawa nine-month profit rise.</title>
<headline>Bogawantalawa nine-month profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Bogawantalawa Plantations Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		     9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    903.98    vs	  687.57</p>
<p>    Net profit	   79.27    vs	   33.37</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is one of six plantations firms which were privatised in 1995.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
